Read(<a x="1"/>) events: Start(a x=[1]) End(a)
Read(<a x="1" y="2" z="3"></a>) events: Start(a x=[1] y=[2] z=[3]) End(a)
Read(<a x=""/>) events: Start(a x=[]) End(a)
Read(<a x="two words">t</a>) events: Start(a x=[two words]) Value[t] End(a)
Read(<a x = "1"/>) events: Start(a x=[1]) End(a)
Read(<a x="it's"/>) events: Start(a x=[it's]) End(a)
Read(<a x="a>b"/>) events: Start(a x=[a>b]) End(a)
Read(<a x="1=2"/>) events: Start(a x=[1=2]) End(a)
Read(<a><b id="7">x</b></a>) events: Start(a) Start(b id=[7]) Value[x] End(b) End(a)
Read(<a\n  x="1"\n  y="2"/>) events: Start(a x=[1] y=[2]) End(a)
